plaintext
* Differential Amplifier Circuit
* Nodes:
* 1: v1 positive terminal
* 2: M1 gate
* 3: RD common node
* 4: Source, IQ
* 5: M2 gate
* 6: vO, M1 and M2 drain
* 7: v2 positive terminal

* Components
M1 6 2 4 4 NMOS
M2 6 5 4 4 NMOS
I1 4 0 DC IQ
R1 3 6 RD
R2 3 7 RD
V1 1 2 DC v1
V2 5 7 DC v2

* Voltage Sources
V+ 0 3 DC V+
V- 4 0 DC V-
